      "content": "#include <bits/stdc++.h>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nint A[1000][1000];\n\ntypedef long long ll;\n\nll solve(int m, int n, int k) {\n  const int bands = min(m, n);\n  const int scan_length = max(m, n);\n  vector<int> prefix(static_cast<size_t>(bands + 1) * scan_length, 0);\n\n  // Each boundary owns one contiguous plane in scan order.\n  if (n < m) {\n    for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) {\n      int sum = 0;\n      for (int j = 0; j < n; j++) {\n        sum += A[i][j];\n        prefix[static_cast<size_t>(j + 1) * scan_length + i] = sum;\n      }\n    }\n  } else {\n    for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) {\n      const int* previous = prefix.data() + static_cast<size_t>(i) * scan_length;\n      int* current = prefix.data() + static_cast<size_t>(i + 1) * scan_length;\n      for (int j = 0; j < n; j++) {\n        current[j] = previous[j] + A[i][j];\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  unordered_map<ll, ll> h;\n  ll ans = 0;\n  for (int first = 1; first <= bands; first++) {\n    const int* before = prefix.data() + static_cast<size_t>(first - 1) * scan_length;\n    for (int last = first; last <= bands; last++) {\n      const int* after = prefix.data() + static_cast<size_t>(last) * scan_length;\n      h.clear();\n      h[0] = 1;\n      ll s = 0;\n      for (int i = 0; i < scan_length; i++) {\n        s += after[i] - before[i];\n        ans += h.find(s - k) != h.end() ? h[s - k] : 0;\n        h[s]++;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  return ans;\n}\n\nint main() {\n  int k, m, n;\n  cin >> k >> m >> n;\n  memset(A, 0, sizeof A);\n\n  for (int i = 0; i < m; i++)\n    for (int j = 0; j < n; j++)\n      cin >> A[i][j];\n\n  cout << solve(m, n, k) << endl;\n  return 0;\n}\n",
      "path": "src/main.cpp"
    }
  ],
  "hypothesis": "Pairing the shorter dimension reduces rectangular-matrix work, while boundary-major prefix storage replaces strided hot-loop reads with two contiguous streams.",
  "notes": "Retains sequential unordered_map counting, query-before-increment ordering, and 64-bit accumulation. Prefix storage is initialized independently on every solve call. No commands or measurements performed.",
